      "message": "spi_slave_abort will be exported when enabling SPI_SLAVE\u003dy.\nspi_slave_abort is not registered to the abi symbol list until SPI_SLAVE_TIME, SPI_SLAVE_SYSTEM_CONTROL, SPIDEV enables as module(\u003dm).",
      "parentUuid": "ef75b176_26788e50",
